lesson: 214
title: Sleeves in the wash
level: primary-3
stars: 1
explain: A sweater, a coat, a shirt with long sleeves — each has 2 sleeves, one for each arm.
explain: A vest has no sleeves at all, so vests add nothing to the number of sleeves.
explain: 4 sweaters, 3 coats and 2 vests in the wash: 4 + 3 = 7 things with sleeves, and 7 × 2 = 14 sleeves.
vars: a=name s=2..9 c=2..6 v=2..5
answer: (s + c) * 2
exercise: {a} puts {s} sweaters and {c} coats in the wash. How many sleeves go into the washing machine?
exercise: There are {s} jumpers and {c} jackets on the washing line. How many sleeves hang on the line?
exercise: Mum irons {s} long-sleeved shirts and {c} coats. How many sleeves does she iron?
exercise: {a} folds {s} sweaters, {c} coats and {v} vests. How many sleeves does {a.he} fold?
exercise: The lost-property box has {s} school jumpers, {c} raincoats and {v} vests. How many sleeves are in the box?
exercise: How many sleeves are there on {s} sweaters and {c} cardigans?
exercise: {s} jumpers n {c} coats in the wash. how many sleeves lol
exercise: washing basket: {s} sweaters, {c} coats, {v} vests. sleeves?
exercise: {a} turned {s+1} — sorry {s} — sweaters right way out plus {c} coats, every sleeve. how many sleeves
exercise: my sis says {v} vests means {v*2} more sleeves. nope. {s} jumpers, {c} jackets, {v} vests, how many sleeves
exercise: line's full, {s} hoodies n {c} coats n {v} vests, oh and socks but who cares. how many sleeves
exercise: {s} cardigans and {c} anoraks on the hooks. sleeves altogether?
test: Count the sleeves on the washing line, where {c} coats hang beside {s} sweaters.
test: In a heap of {v} vests, {s} jumpers and {c} raincoats, how many sleeves are there?
test: {a} has to roll up every sleeve of {s} shirts with long sleeves and {c} jackets. How many sleeves does {a.he} roll up?
test: What is the number of sleeves on {c} coats and {s} sweaters together?
test: {c} coats + {s} jumpers + {v} vests. sleeves?
test: ironing pile, {s} shirts long sleeves n {c} coats, oh n {v} vests. how many sleeves to iron
test: The jumble sale sells {s} jumpers, {v} vests and {c} cardigans. How many sleeves are there among them?
exam: A laundry load comprises {s} sweaters, {c} coats and {v} sleeveless vests. Determine the aggregate number of sleeves contained therein.
exam: Given that {s.words} long-sleeved shirts and {c.words} jackets are suspended upon a line, ascertain the total number of sleeves.
exam: Compute the number of sleeves to be pressed, it being given that the items to be ironed are {s} jumpers and {c} coats.
exam: Whereas a lost-property receptacle holds {v} vests, {s} pullovers and {c} raincoats, state the number of sleeves in the receptacle.
exercise: Since Dad was made redundant, his work overalls stay in the cupboard, and only {s} sweaters, {c} coats and {v} vests go in the wash. How many sleeves go into the machine?
exercise: baby had an "accident" all over {s} jumpers n {c} coats, plus {v} vests. bloody hell. how many sleeves have i gotta scrub
test: {a} was creative with the truth: {a.he} said {a.he} had washed {s+3} sweaters, but the basket shows only {s} sweaters, {c} coats and {v} vests were washed. How many sleeves really went through the wash?
